# Model Checkpoints & Large Weights (>100MB / ~30GB total)
# Full checkpoints cannot be pushed to standard GitHub due to 100MB file limits.
# Individual safetensors checkpoints (>1GB) are hosted on Hugging Face / Cloud Archive.
# Tokenizers, configs, and training logs are tracked in Git.
models/**/checkpoint-*/
checkpoint-*/
*.safetensors
*.bin
optimizer.pt
training_args.bin

# Unignore the trained neural fusion model and scaler (tracked in Git!)
!models/multimodal_fusion/fusion_model.pt
!models/multimodal_fusion/fusion_scaler.joblib

# Large Datasets & Intermediate Features
# Master CSV datasets, splits, and manifests are tracked in Git.
# Intermediate loose single-item vectors (160k files) are excluded.
FINAL_DATASETS/TEXT_SARCASM/text_sarcasm_combined.csv
FINAL_DATASETS/MULTIMODAL_SARCASM/**/features/
*.npy
*.npz
sarc/train-balanced-sarc.csv

